          no shared cache serving other users. No fixed version exists yet (4.3.0 is latest).
        expires: 2027-02-09T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964064:
    - 'astro > http-cache-semantics':
        reason: >-
          Not exploitable: same as SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964068 (build-time only, no remote images,
          no shared cache). No fixed version exists yet.
